5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to begin this process with you all. To ensure our growth remains sustainable and our reporting remains transparent, I wish to examine the appraisal needs at the last audit and independent checks on holdings' reported figures.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we need to be more critical of our historical success. I will look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off to see what actually drove our returns.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to ensure our long-term financial stability. I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to get started! I really want to make sure we aren't overstretching ourselves with hiring. I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the actual timeline from investment to operation. I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is wise that we each bring a different lens to this evaluation. A balanced perspective is the only way to navigate the complexities of the market. I am content with my choices for now.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Diversifying our focus prevents blind spots. I am satisfied with my selections and will wait for the results to see if our past narratives align with the actual data.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree. By covering these different operational and financial angles, we can form a comprehensive view of our current position before committing further capital. I have no further additions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I think we've got all the bases covered! I can't wait to see what we find out. I'm all set and ready for the results!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The current distribution of focus is sufficient. I will wait for the data to see where the bottlenecks typically occur.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
