61,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Looking at these options, Ledger Bridge appeals to me. Its software-based nature and dashboard focus suggest a reporting process that is straightforward and avoids the costly, time-consuming appraisals associated with physical hardware.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Ledger Bridge is the most logical choice. It mirrors the back-office tooling that actually drove our past returns and likely offers the high retention and low overhead we need.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Ledger Bridge is the most sustainable option. Unlike the others, it avoids heavy physical infrastructure and hardware, minimizing the risk of unexpected follow-on calls and preserving our limited reserves.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Ledger Bridge sounds perfect! It's all software, so we won't be hunting for field crews for months. Plus, our software partners are already busy, but this seems the leanest on hiring!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Ledger Bridge is the only viable option. Clinic Scheduler faces medical security reviews, and Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop depend on hardware or physical facilities. Ledger Bridge offers the most predictable path to deployment.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is rare to see such harmony in a room. When the path to clarity is this evident, the most compassionate act for ourselves and our fund is to embrace it without hesitation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,The consensus is based on a shared desire for stability and predictability. Ledger Bridge aligns with the data on our successful exits and avoids the churn risks associated with consumer-facing tools.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"The alignment here is practical. Ledger Bridge minimizes capital intensity and avoids the physical assets that our current credit line fails to value, ensuring we don't further strain our liquidity.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'm just so happy we all agree! It's a huge relief to know we won't be stressing over hiring field crews or sorting facility staff. Ledger Bridge is definitely the way to go!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The logic is sound. By eliminating the risks of medical data regulations and physical supply chains, we remove the variables that have historically derailed our timelines. Ledger Bridge is the only choice that ensures reliability.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us move toward the final vote with a peaceful heart. When a choice serves both the fund's health and the well-being of its people, it is the only choice worth making.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I have no reason to deviate from this conclusion. Ledger Bridge is the only candidate that satisfies the requirement for a lean, high-retention model without the operational baggage of the other options.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I am confident in this choice. Ledger Bridge is the only candidate that protects our reserves from unpredictable follow-on calls and avoids the capital intensity that would further jeopardize our liquidity.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm totally on board! Ledger Bridge is the best fit for our team and our sanity. I'm voting for them with a big smile!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
