76,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I have no further doubts. Ledger Bridge avoids the regulatory and physical bottlenecks that cause systemic delays. It is the only candidate that offers the predictability I require. I am ready to vote.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Servas,,"May we all find tranquility in this decision. I cast my vote for Ledger Bridge, for it promises a future of transparency and a respite from the burdens of our quarter-end.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I cast my vote for Ledger Bridge. It is the only candidate that aligns with the actual drivers of our past success while minimizing the risk of customer churn.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,I cast my vote for Ledger Bridge. It is the only candidate that ensures our financial stability by minimizing capital intensity and protecting our remaining reserves from unpredictable follow-on calls.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
